AI-Lab patch to ds-yue-webui (YuE2 Studio): the "window" job kind, which regenerates one
window of a finished song (docs/music.md, "YuE2: regenerating one window of a song").
Base: DocShotgun/ds-yue-webui a7130aa7bef8f278edbc24e15e39b42806eb30df
Apply in the Studio checkout (engines.yue2.webui_root):  git apply <this file>
Then restart the YuE2 instance. Check: its tests/test_window.py.

